# Large source archives are fetched, not committed. `scripts/fetch_data.sh`
# re-downloads every one of them, and every test that needs one skips cleanly
# when it is absent — so a fresh clone is green before any of this arrives.
#
# What IS committed is everything small enough to make a result reproducible
# without a network: the GenBank records, the Loghub samples, the RFC texts, the
# eCFR version index, the TSPLIB instance and its proven optimum, and the two
# tables derived from the retail spreadsheet.
online_retail_ii.zip
osv_pypi.zip
ami_manual.zip
synthea_csv.zip
locomo10.json
un_consolidated.xml
_online_retail.xlsx
osv/
*.part
